      "body_html": "<div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 424w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 848w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1272w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080\" width=\"1080\" height=\"720\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:720,&quot;width&quot;:1080,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;a calculator and a pen sitting on top of a piece of paper&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;a calculator and a pen sitting on top of a piece of paper&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"a calculator and a pen sitting on top of a piece of paper\" title=\"a calculator and a pen sitting on top of a piece of paper\" srcset=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 424w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 848w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1272w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1648201637025-1c77b9be3013?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxjYWxjdWxhdG9yfGVufDB8fHx8MTc5MzE3NDkxNnww&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Photo by <a href=\"https://unsplash.com/@alefler\">Aaron Lefler</a> on <a href=\"https://unsplash.com\">Unsplash</a></figcaption></figure></div><p>At current API rates, GPT-6 Astra costs <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/pricing\">a hundred times as much per token</a> as GPT-6 Luna. Before paying that premium, I want to know what it actually buys.</p><p>The price of a token is only part of the cost of a task. Providers charge separately for the text a model receives and the text it generates, measured in units called tokens. The prompt and final answer can be the visible ends of a much longer process. A reasoning model generates intermediate tokens <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/reasoning\">billed as output</a>. An agent may write commands, read documents and tool results, and go through the same material again as it works.</p><p>A model that reaches a good result in fewer attempts can therefore be cheaper to use even at a higher rate. For a calculation, a short calculator command may save a long stretch of generated arithmetic, although <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/agents-api/observability\">the command and returned result still consume tokens</a> and the tool may have its own charge. More reasoning can also make the result worse: in an <a href=\"https://alignment.anthropic.com/2025/inverse-scaling/\">Anthropic study using constructed tasks</a>, extending the reasoning sometimes reduced accuracy.</p><p>The quality of the result changes the calculation too. In <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/cookbook/examples/partners/harness_aware_plugin_evals/harness_aware_plugin_evals\">one evaluation run of a Bureau of Labor Statistics plugin</a> on 108 held-out questions, Astra achieved a 94% pass rate and Luna 88%. Six percentage points can look like a modest difference. But on the task I need done, the difference may be between code that works and code with a critical bug. If I have to find and fix the bug, that work may cost far more than the tokens. A mistake that goes unnoticed can cost more still.</p><p>I would choose a model much as I would choose someone for a job. Benchmarks and <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/model-selection\">model recommendations</a> help me decide whom to consider; I still want to see the work. For a task I do often, it is worth <a href=\"https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/choosing-a-model\">trying several models</a> and a few reasoning settings. If the cheaper model does the job well, there is no reason to pay more. If I keep having to correct it, I may be saving on tokens while paying for the difference with my own time.</p>"
    },
