      "id": 219977494,
      "title": "The Pope in the Chapel of Stained Glass",
      "subtitle": "",
      "description": "Pope Leo’s new encyclical warns repeatedly about the concentration of power in AI: a few institutions may set the rules, shape what people see, and make consequential decisions through systems outsiders cannot inspect.",
